  <h2>Born from Heartbreak</h2>
  <p>This guide was created by Nate Aframian after losing his soul dog, Oxmo—a golden retriever whose love knew no bounds and whose absence left an immeasurable void.</p>
  <p>In the depths of that grief, Nate discovered that losing a dog isn't just losing a pet. It's saying goodbye to family, a best friend, a constant companion who loved unconditionally.</p>
  <p class="blue-text semi-bold">The Dog Grief Guide was born from that heartbreak—a companion for those navigating the same painful journey, created by someone who truly understands.</p>
